'''Aurorus''' (Japanese: '''アマルルガ''' ''Amaruruga'') is a {{ct|Water}} Stage 2 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Fantastical Parade}} expansion.

