===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Forbidden Light|Aurorus|28}} from the {{TCG|Forbidden Light}} expansion.
*'''Hail Prison''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Unbroken Bonds|Kyurem|50}} from the {{TCG|Unbroken Bonds}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Shield}}.

